（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(23年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"33.8\" width=\"320\" height=\"11.700000000000003\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,73.5 9.1,76.5 14.2,75.4 19.3,78.9 24.5,75.9 29.6,76.4 34.7,75.4 39.8,74.9 44.9,75.7 50.0,80.5 55.1,82.5 60.3,84.2 65.4,79.3 70.5,84.0 75.6,90.5 80.7,97.2 85.8,93.4 91.0,83.4 96.1,83.5 101.2,83.6 106.3,89.1 111.4,84.7 116.5,82.2 121.6,81.0 126.8,70.4 131.9,74.6 137.0,77.3 142.1,61.2 147.2,75.1 152.3,77.6 157.4,77.2 162.6,71.9 167.7,79.8 172.8,81.7 177.9,77.1 183.0,80.1 188.1,67.8 193.2,65.7 198.4,62.7 203.5,58.5 208.6,66.4 213.7,50.8 218.8,56.2 223.9,43.9 229.0,42.3 234.2,27.5 239.3,16.7 244.4,23.6 249.5,26.9 254.6,12.8 259.7,22.5 264.9,31.3 270.0,43.8 275.1,33.7 280.2,23.0 285.3,28.7 290.4,37.5 295.5,35.0 300.7,25.3 305.8,19.7 310.9,38.8 316.0,31.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 85.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 85.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 85.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 270.0 55.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 295.5 47.0 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"31.5\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display: